WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.314
Sometimes the right event starts
with how you want people to feel.

00:00:03.718 --> 00:00:08.099
A quiet brunch and a dance floor
after dark call for very different rooms.

00:00:08.498 --> 00:00:10.311
At Mommy and Daddy Break Club,

00:00:10.696 --> 00:00:14.116
a morning might move
from gentle movement to coffee, brunch,

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:17.385
and a conversation that actually
has time to finish.

00:00:17.784 --> 00:00:21.176
Retro Glam Sessions builds
each edition around one decade.

00:00:21.575 --> 00:00:23.814
The stage lighting, the DJ set

00:00:23.924 --> 00:00:26.987
and the photo moments all
speak the same visual language.

00:00:27.385 --> 00:00:31.369
We produce these experiences ourselves,
coordinating catering,

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:35.284
décor, multimedia, staffing and logistics.

00:00:35.682 --> 00:00:38.539
A brand can ask about
sampling or sponsorship

00:00:38.553 --> 00:00:39.940
when an edition has an opening.

00:00:40.338 --> 00:00:43.360
Every year,
our team produces more than two hundred

00:00:43.374 --> 00:00:47.632
and fifty small and midsize events,
in addition to corporate productions.

00:00:48.031 --> 00:00:50.957
That practice shows up
in the details guests remember.

00:00:51.355 --> 00:00:53.525
Find the edition that feels right for you.

00:00:53.924 --> 00:00:55.270
Join its interest list.

00:00:55.668 --> 00:00:59.597
If you're a brand, ask about partnering
with one of our experiences.
